{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-model-of-cultivation","title":"修身的楷模","url":"/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-model-of-cultivation","wordCount":1338,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/c/people/zeng-guofan/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1452,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章对曾国藩作出综合评价。\"修身的楷模\"，是对曾国藩崇高地位最贴切的尊称——他作为自我修养的典范、奋斗励志的榜样、人生智慧的宝库，成就了\"三不朽\"。而全面的评判，则要求我们既充分肯定其作为\"修身楷模\"的崇高修养、奋斗精神与深刻智慧，又客观正视他作为历史人物的复杂性与争议性（如镇压起义），以全面、辩证、历史的眼光，认识这位复杂而深刻的历史人物。\n"}